rapporteur . - ( ES ) Mr President , in agreement with several groups , I wish to present an oral amendment intended to replace , in the first line of paragraph 1 ( b ) , ` the aim ' , with the phrase : ` some of the aims ' , and to replace ` is gradually to liberalise trade ' with the phrase , ` should be the establishment in time of an advanced free trade area ' . 
