All these questions are currently of great concern to our sectors and to us . 
author . - ( ES ) Mr President , I was lucky enough to be part of the Election Observation Mission that participated in the elections held in August in Sierra Leone and I must say first and foremost that we were all extremely impressed with how professionally the mission , led by my Group colleague , Mrs Isler Béguin , was run and is still being run . 
