That is why Parliament believes that the efforts made under the French Presidency to breathe new life into the Barcelona Process are important . 
That is also why , in the Committee on Constitutional Affairs , we have actively collaborated on the report by Mrs Napoletano , whom I wish to thank for her patience and understanding . 
Why was the Committee on Constitutional Affairs concerned with this subject , Mr President ? 
We also tried to help the Council with the important decisions that it had to make . 
Moreover , the ministers recognised it shortly afterwards , which , Mr President , reflects once again this desire to cooperate with the Council . 
